Z||000023||Phil||10-24-1999||06:58 AM||||On removing fastback sail panels- the original ones had a piece of fishing line or the like behind the double back tape and you just pulled on the line and it cut through the tape. I used regular 30 lb. line and started in one corner and sort of sawed through the tape||||reg||1
